P:7CE8:GetNoteLenRts
P:7CE9:SongOffsets:song number (from 1) -> offset of its header from here
P:7CFB:SongHdrFloorClear:song header (6 bytes): note length set (offset into NoteLengths), data address, TRI / SQ1 / NOISE offsets in the data (0 = channel unused); SQ2 starts at offset 0
P:7D00:SongHdrHurry
P:7D05:SongHdrPause
P:7D0A:SongHdrUnpause:request $80 (sub_88A8)
P:7D0F:SongHdrGameStart
P:7D14:SongHdrGameOver
P:7D19:SongHdrEnding
P:7D1E:SongHdrBgmA:songs 1, 9-12, 15, 16
P:7D24:SongHdrBgmB:songs 13, 14, 18
P:7D2A:SongHdrBgmC:song 17
P:7D30:SongBgmA:song data: SQ2 notes from offset 0; byte >= $80 = new note length (GetNoteLen), else note, $00 = end
P:7D44:SongBgmB
P:7D58:SongBgmC
P:7D78:SongFloorClear
P:7DA9:SongGameStart
P:7E1B:SongGameOver
P:7E5D:SongHurry
P:7E65:SongPause
P:7E6B:SongUnpause
P:7E71:SongEnding
P:7F00:NotePeriods:note -> timer period, high byte then low byte (index 0 = rest)
P:7F58:NoteLengths:note length in frames; songs pick a set of 8 by noteLenOffset
P:7F7E:Sq2Envelope:SQ2 volume by envelope step (counts down)
P:7F8E:Sq1Envelope:SQ1 volume by envelope step
P:7FCD:Sq1SfxVolume:sq1 effect 1: volume by sq1SfxTimer
P:7FE2:DmcStarts:DMC sample start address >> 6, per sample
P:7FEC:DmcLengths:DMC sample length >> 4, per sample
P:7FF0:Irq:IRQ/BRK vector: points at data; never used (no CLI anywhere, $4017 bit 6 set by UpdateSound)
R:10:ppuCtrlShadow:last value written to PPUCTRL
R:11:ppuMaskShadow:last value written to PPUMASK
R:12:scrollX:horizontal scroll, low byte (high byte: scrollPage)
R:13:scrollY:vertical scroll, always 0 (only InitPpuCtrlScroll writes it, with 0)
R:14:joypads:2 bytes per pad (pad 1 at +0, pad 2 at +2): held buttons, then held buttons with A only on its first frame
R:18:rngState:64-bit shift register, rotated right every NMI with feedback bit1 ^ bit9
R:20:timerTick:counts 10..0: the slow timers tick when it wraps
R:21:timersFast:decremented to 0 every NMI; +0 player action, +10..+13 enemy actions (Data Crystal)
R:23:actionLockTimer:timersFast+2: player actions are locked while it runs (attack pose time)
R:24:walkCarryTimer:timersFast+3: set to 6 on each scroll step; while it runs a stopped player keeps lastWalk
R:25:boss4CastTimer:timersFast+4: boss 4 cast / double timing (SetBossTimers, Boss4Cast)
R:2A:scrollTimer:timersFast+9: UpdateFloorScroll
R:2B:objActTimer:objActTimer+slot: per-object action timer (slots 0-4 enemies, +5 the boss)
R:32:bossHitWindow:timersFast+17: frames after a boss hit in which a second hit counts (bossHitAgain)
R:33:spawnGapTimer:timersFast+18: frames before the next enemy of a group; the ending reuses it
R:35:timersSlow:decremented to 0 every 11th NMI
R:36:modeWaitTimer:timersSlow+1: wait before the next mode step (title idle -> demo, death, game over)
R:37:floorStartTimer:timersSlow+2: FloorStartHandler
R:38:sceneTimer:timersSlow+3: floor-clear steps (FloorClear*), Sylvia scene
R:3B:scrollActiveTimer:timersSlow+6: set to $1A on each spawnStep change; 0 = the player stands still (spawn side pattern 2, delay $38)
R:3C:bossWaitTimer:timersSlow+7: $9C when the boss comes on screen; boss 4 double, boss 5 walk
R:3D:floor2DropTimer:timersSlow+8: before the next floor-2 object (Floor2ObjDelay)
R:3E:bossHealTimer:timersSlow+9: bossHealth + 1 every $0D slow ticks while it is below HEALTH_FULL (UpdateHud)
R:3F:objSlowTimer:objSlowTimer+slot: per-object slow timer (+5 the boss)
R:47:floorMarkerTimer:timersSlow+18: blink of the floor marker (BlinkFloorMarker)
R:49:frameCounter:incremented every NMI (unless $0366/$0367 are set)
R:4A:groupWait:frames before the next spawn group starts: GroupDelays[floor*4+difficulty] (+$30 in game A)
R:4B:sprLenA:bytes used in sprListA
R:4C:sprLenB:bytes used in sprListB
R:4D:sprLenC:bytes used in sprListC
R:4E:oamIndex:next free byte in oamBuffer while BuildOam copies the sprite lists (starts at $18)
R:4F:modeStep:step index into the current ModeScripts list (RunGameMode)
R:50:displayOn:non-zero: rendering on, gameMode handler runs; 0: PPU off, ModeScripts set the screen up
R:51:gameMode:index into GameModeHandlers / ModeScripts
R:52:ppuJob:index into PpuJobLo/Hi: data written to the PPU at the next NMI, then cleared
R:53:gameB:gameSelect bit 0: game B (TitleHandler)
R:54:gameSelect:title menu choice 0-3 = 1P A, 1P B, 2P A, 2P B: bit0 game B (copied to gameB), bit1 two players
R:55:currentPlayer:0/1
R:56:defeatCount:per player: times the game was finished, incremented after the ending (Data Crystal)
R:58:playerFloor:per player: floor 0-4 (Data Crystal "Current stage")
R:5A:floorEvent:handler run by RunFloorEvents (FloorEventHandlers)
R:5C:lives:per player; 3 at the start (also GameHacking.org, Data Crystal)
R:5E:curDefeatCount:defeatCount of the current player (LoadPlayerState); difficulty = min(curDefeatCount, 3)
R:5F:floor:floor 0-4 of the current player, indexes the per-floor tables
R:60:floorClearStep:index into FloorClearSteps
R:61:scrollNametable:scrollPage & 1: nametable shown at scrollX 0
R:62:playerEdgeXHi:high byte of playerEdgeX
R:63:ppuCtrlExtra:ORed into PPUCTRL by SetGameScroll: $08 (sprites from $1000) during the floor-clear walk, else 0
R:64:playerEdgeX:player walk offset once the floor stops scrolling at either end; 0 while it scrolls
R:65:scrollPage:high byte of scrollX: 6 at the start of floor 1, 0 at its end (boss)
R:66:scrollMoved:sum of the scroll steps; objects add it to keep their place on the floor
R:67:playerWalk:walk direction from playerInput: 0 none, 1 right, 2 left (both = 1); cleared by attacks and hits
R:68:playerPose:animation step of playerAction; counts down (GameHacking.org: $09 = crawling stance)
R:69:playerAction:PA_* bits: facing, crouch, jump, hit, punch, kick; bits 1-3 index PlayerActionHandlers
R:6A:playerInput:buttons of the current player (joypads or the demo script, BTN_* bits)
R:6B:hardRules:gameB, or 1 in the demo (Mesen): shorter group and knife-thrower delays, fewer grippers needed to drain
R:6C:timerMode:1 = floor timer running; 0 = stopped (player killed); 2 = time bonus tally (no hurry, no TIME OVER)
R:6D:titleClearUnused:cleared by TitleInit, never read
R:6E:lastStep:last walk step returned by WalkStep
R:6F:scriptInitDone:ModeScripts: InitPpu ran for this script (cleared by RestartModeScript)
R:70:hudToggle:flips every frame without a player frame job: 1 = UpdateTopScore / PutTopScore, 0 = DrawPagePlaque
R:71:floorBanner:nonzero while the "PLAYER n FLOOR n" banner is up: WaitSprite0Hit adds an unscrolled split for it
R:72:lastWalk:playerWalk of the last scroll step
R:73:spawnStepFine:scroll steps 0-$17 within one spawnStep
R:74:spawnStep:position in the floor's spawn table; moves with the scroll ($18 steps each)
R:75:spawnLeft:enemies still to come in the current group (3 or 4)
R:76:spawnDelaySet:index into SpawnDelays: $10 when the spawn byte has bits 0-1 set, + random 0-$0C
R:77:spawnSides:side pattern of the group (SpawnSides), spawn byte bits 3-5
R:78:floor2ObjCount:floor-2 objects spawned so far
R:79:floorMarkerBlink:0/1, toggled by BlinkFloorMarker
R:7A:bossStep:step of the current attack (counts down), or the cast step of the floor 4 boss
R:7B:bossPhase:0 approach, 1 back off, 2-4 attack kind (ChooseBossAttack); floor 5 also 5 jump, 6 block, 7 knocked back
R:7C:bossAttacksLeft:attacks before backing off (SetBossAttackCount)
R:7D:boss4Trick:floor 4 boss hit by an attack other than attackKind 2 (no damage): 1-2 a sprite falls off, 3 vanish, 4 reappear, 5 pose, 0 (Mesen); 7-9 with the double OBJ_BOSS4_DOUBLE (Mesen)
R:7E:bossActive:2 at floor start (boss waiting), 1 once the boss came on screen near the edge (boss palette, bossWaitTimer), 0 when its slot is freed (Mesen: 0-2)
R:7F:boss5JumpStep:index into Boss5JumpY, counts down
R:80:objState:per object slot (0-4 enemies, 5 boss, 6 player; checked in Mesen): 0 = free
R:87:objType:per object slot: index into ObjectHandlers; boss of floor 1 = 3, player = 9
R:8E:objX:screen X (player $80); slots 0-6 objects, 7-10 the floor 4 flyer points, 11-13 fragments, 14-16 effects (WorldToScreenX)
R:9F:objXHi:1 = on screen, else the page offset off screen; free slots drift around $7A-$7F
R:B0:objY:Y, $87 on the ground; $D8 and more = fell off the screen
R:B7:objPose:animation pose; first one per objType from a table; knife throwers throw on poses 4 and 6 (KT_POSE_*)
R:BE:difficulty:min(curDefeatCount, 3): selects speeds and delays (GroupDelays, knife speed)
R:C0:objFacing:0 = facing left, 1 = facing right (Mesen: grippers always face the player); OBJ_BURST keeps other values here
R:C7:objStep:per slot: step counter of ObjAppear/ObjVanish and the dragon steps (DragonHandler)
R:CE:objWorldX:X on the floor (scroll coordinates), same slots as objX; +6 = the player
R:DF:objWorldXHi:page of objWorldX
R:F0:musicSq2Pos:SQ2 read offset in musicData
R:F1:sq1SfxPlaying:request bits of the square-1 effect being played
R:F2:sq2SfxPlaying:request bits of the square-2 effect being played (the music leaves SQ2 alone meanwhile)
R:F3:pausedSong:musicPlaying saved by the pause jingle ($40), restarted after it
R:F4:musicSq1Pos:SQ1 read offset in musicData (0 = unused)
R:F5:musicPlaying:request bits of the song being played
R:F6:sq1SfxTimer
R:F7:noteLenOffset:first of the song's 8 note lengths in NoteLengths
R:F8:musicTriPos:TRI read offset in musicData (0 = unused)
R:F9:musicData:data of the song being played
R:FB:musicQueue:music request (bit per song), cleared by UpdateSound every frame
R:FC:noiseSfxQueue:noise effect request
R:FD:dmcSfxQueue:DMC sample request
R:FE:sq2SfxQueue:square-2 effect request
R:FF:sq1SfxQueue:square-1 effect request
R:200:oamBuffer:sprite buffer, copied by OAMDMA in the NMI
R:300:ppuBufLen:bytes used in ppuBuffer
R:301:ppuBuffer:($0301-$035E) PPU string records built at run time (ppuJob 0-4)
R:35F:metaColumnX:DrawMetasprite: screen X of columns 1-6 at +1..+6, $FF = off screen (+0 unused)
R:366:paused
R:367:pauseDelay:START ignored while non-zero ($28 frames after a toggle)
R:368:timeOver:set when the floor timer runs out; ppuJob TIME OVER
R:369:startHeld:START edge detection for the pause
R:36A:lastUpButton:BUTTON_UP of the last frame: a jump needs a new press (CheckPlayerJump)
R:36B:attackLatch:per player: A/B bits that already started an attack; cleared on release (no auto-fire)
R:36D:curSlot:UpdateObjects: slot whose handler is running
R:36E:lastPlayerPose:playerPose of the last frame
R:36F:lastPlayerAction:playerAction of the last frame
R:372:floorGoesRight:floor & 1: 1 on floors 2 and 4 (walked rightwards), 0 on the others
R:373:grabbers:grippers holding the player, per side: +0 and +1 (+1 was "invincible" in GameHacking.org)
R:375:grabberSlots:per side: object slots of the holding grippers, 2 bits each
R:377:grabTimer:frames held: the shake-off loosens 1-4 grippers depending on it
R:378:shakeOffCount:presses left to shake off a grabbing enemy, 0-4 (Data Crystal "Shrug off enemy counter") (Mesen: 0-4)
R:379:attackKind:ATTACK_*: 0 punch, 1 kick, +2 crouching, 4/5 jumping (PlayerAttackBox)
R:37A:hitDamage:subtracted from objHealth by DamageObject
R:37B:floorGoesRightCopy:= floorGoesRight at SetupFloor, never read
R:37C:liveEnemies:grippers, small enemies and knife throwers alive (+1 per spawn, -1 when one is removed)
R:37D:drawIndex:DrawObjects: current index into drawOrder
R:37E:throwerTimer:per side: enemies left before the next one from this side becomes a knife thrower
R:380:throwerSides:bit per side (BitMasks): a knife thrower is on that side (MarkSpawnBit; FreeObject clears it)
R:381:throwsPerTurn:knife thrower: throws before it turns (KnifeThrowsPerTurn by difficulty)
R:382:throwerTurnDelay:knife thrower: objSlowTimer after throwsPerTurn throws, before it turns (KnifeTurnDelay)
R:383:lowThrowChance:knife thrower: rngState below it -> low throw, else high (KnifeLowChance)
R:384:plaqueColumn:PPU address low byte of the wall plaques, from PlaqueColumn (SetupFloor)
R:385:plaqueDrawn:DrawPagePlaque: nonzero once this page's plaque is queued
R:386:multiHitCount:CheckPlayerHits: objects hit before this one by the same attack (more points)
R:387:spawnSlot:object slot of the last spawned enemy
R:388:playerLost:$10 once the player's slot was freed (life lost): the play loop waits for modeWaitTimer
R:38A:walkPoseTime:ObjWalkStep: objActTimer between walk poses (9 for the player and the floor 1/3 bosses)
R:38B:walkSpeedFrac:ObjWalkStep: objSubX step per frame ($C0, $80 in the floor-clear walk)
R:38C:boss5Alert:set by the player's first hit on the floor 5 boss: from then it may jump over or block attacks; cleared when it backs off
R:38D:playerKnockedOut:$FF when playerHealth runs out (PlayerHitRecover stops)
R:38F:playerFrameChanged:1 when the player frame job has to be sent this frame
R:390:floorTime:floor timer, one decimal digit per byte (1000s, 100s, 10s, 1s), starts at 2000
R:394:hopUnused:per slot 0-3: cleared when a hop starts, never read
R:398:boss4PieceX:Boss4Trick: X of the sprite that falls off the boss
R:399:boss4PieceY:Boss4Trick: Y of that sprite (ends at $E8)
R:39A:bossHitAgain:boss 2/4: set on a hit, bossHitWindow = $10; a second hit in that time pushes boss 2 back 16 px or makes boss 4 vanish; boss 4 sparks: spark counter
R:39B:boss4DoubleOn:floor 4: the double exists (Boss4TryDouble .. Boss4DoubleEnd)
R:39C:boss4DoubleSlot:slot of the floor 4 double
R:39D:boss4InRange:floor 4: boss on screen within $40 of the player (Boss4CheckRange); cleared during boss4Trick 1-6
R:39E:boss4DoubleCastStep:Boss4DoubleHandler: Boss4CastTime / Boss4CastPoses index, counts down from 3
R:39F:boss4DoubleDist:objDistance of the boss when the double appears: the double keeps it on the other side
R:3A0:endingStep
R:3A1:endingAnim
R:3A2:popupTimer:per slot: frames left of the score popup (DrawScorePopups)
R:3AA:throwerDelay:reload value of throwerTimer: ThrowerSpawnDelay[floor*4+difficulty] (+2 in game A)
R:3AB:timerFrac:floor timer fraction (+$10 per tick, $34 = one unit)
R:3AC:shakeLastInput:playerInput (directions) of the last frame while held by grippers: changes count as shakes
R:3AD:knifeFracX:per knife: X fraction (KnifeSpeedFrac)
R:3B1:killCount:enemies beaten; every $0C-th gripper beaten with a jump kick gives a bonus
R:3B2:bigHealthBonus:nonzero: HealthBonus gives 100 points per health unit instead of 10; set only by ScrollCheckBossArea (never seen executed)
R:3C2:drawOrder:slot numbers in drawing order (DrawObjects reads index 6 first); 0-3 sorted by SortSlotsByDistance
R:3C9:sparkAttr:hit spark sprite attributes (set by the hit checks, DrawHitSparks)
R:3CD:demoInputIndex
R:3CF:floor4EventsOn:3 while Floor4Events run, 0 afterwards (UpdateObjects treats flyers differently)
R:3D0:knifeY:$90 high or $A8 low
R:3D4:knifeX
R:3D8:sparkState:hit sparks: 1 = new, then the timer (timersFast+5,X) runs
R:3DC:sparkY
R:3E0:sparkX
R:3E4:throwerHold:per thrower: nonzero = held at a stop point (3: floor 5 while the boss is there, page 3; 1/other: at a floor end, code only); KnifeThrowerKeepRange then only faces its OBJST_FACING side
R:3E8:knifeThrowStep:per thrower: index into KnifeThrowPoses; $F0 after the throw
R:3EC:knifeState:per thrower slot 0-3: 0 = none, 1 / $11 = flying, bit4 flips the sprite
R:3F0:knifeThrowCount:per thrower: throws since the last turn (up to throwsPerTurn)
R:3F4:throwerTurnedBack:per thrower: set when it turned back after its first throw (KnifeThrowerKeepRange)
R:3F8:boomerangState:0 = none, 1-4 flight phases
R:3FA:boomerangFracX:per boomerang: X fraction (+$A0 a frame)
R:3FC:burstWobble:per slot: BurstObjHandler wobble steps (3..0): new random vertical bits in objFacing every 4 frames
R:400:boomerangX
R:402:boomerangXHi:objXHi of the boss when thrown; 2 or odd decides when it comes back
R:404:boomerangY:starts at $92 (high) or $A8 (low, when boomerangKind is 9 or $0E), then moves by a step each frame (Mesen: $8C-$A8)
R:406:boomerangKind:RandomByDifficulty result: throw pose (BoomerangThrowPoses) and height ($FF/9/4 pick the arc direction)
R:408:boomerangSpeed:MoveBoomerang speed; negative = turn (state 3)
R:40A:boomerangFrame:animation frame 0-4
R:40C:boomerangArcStep:index into BoomerangArcDY, counts down; 9 or <0 ends the arc
R:40E:boomerangLive:1 from the throw until the boomerang is gone (CheckBoomerangHits)
R:410:hopState:per slot 0-3: OBJST_ALT small enemy hops over a crouching player at distance $2E-$31 (SmallEnemyContact)
R:414:hopStep:hop progress
R:418:hopStartY:objY when the hop started
R:41C:hopRise:height of the hop above hopStartY
R:420:bossAttackWait:boss 2/4: non-zero while the boss holds an attack pose; SetBossTimers stores A here (Mesen: 0, 1, 3)
R:421:fragmentY
R:424:fragmentSpeedX:per fragment: X speed (high nibble FragmentStepFrac index, low nibble FragmentStep)
R:427:fragmentSpeedY:per fragment: Y speed, same format
R:42A:fragmentFracX
R:42D:fragmentFracY
R:430:fragmentActive
R:433:knifeAttr:sprite attributes
R:437:effectTile:$DB -> $DC -> $F0, 0 = free
R:43A:effectTimer
R:43D:effectY:per effect: Y (SpawnEffect, DrawEffects)
R:440:flyerPointWait:per flyer point: frames before it releases a flyer ($50 game B, $68 game A)
R:444:flyerMode:per slot: floor 4 flyer move: 0 wait (FlyerStateWait), 1 straight, 2 dive (FlyerWaveA), 3 dive (FlyerWaveB, longer), 4/5 the two halves of a turn, 6 hover (FlyerStateHandlers)
R:44A:flyerWaveDir:per slot: direction of the small vertical wave: 0 down, 1 up (AddFlyerWave)
R:450:flyerPointY:objY of the floor 4 flyer points (slots 7-10, Floor4FlyerY); flyers start at +4
R:454:flyerPattern:per slot: index into FlyerSpeed / FlyerWaveA / FlyerWaveB (Floor4Events)
R:45A:flyerDiveStep:per slot: dive counter; at FlyerDiveLimit flyerDiveDir flips (the first time a new move is picked)
R:460:flyerDiveDir:per slot: dive direction: 0 down, 1 up (MoveFlyer)
R:466:flyerWavePhase:per slot: small wave counter; flyerWaveDir flips at $18
R:46C:flyerWaveFrac:per slot: Y fraction of the small wave (AddFlyerWave)
R:472:flyerState:per slot: turn counter, -= $0A in flyerMode 4 from $FF, += $0A in mode 5 (FlyerStateDec / FlyerStateInc)
R:478:objSubStep:per slot: pot fall / burst / flyer / missile step
R:480:objSubY:Y fraction (SinkObject)
R:486:objFallStep:index into the fall step table, up to $17 (Mesen: 0-$17)
R:48E:hurryOn:set with MUSIC_HURRY
R:48F:bossDmcSfx:BossHitDmc[floor], stored when the player dies from a hit (hitThisFrame); PlayHandler queues it $0A slow ticks later
R:490:objWasHit:per slot: set by the player's hit; the boss handlers clear it (+5)
R:496:playerHit:set by the hit checks when an enemy, knife or boss hits the player
R:498:objSubX:X fraction (WalkStep)
R:4A0:objHealth:+5 = bossHealth, +6 = playerHealth; $FF = knocked out (checked in Mesen)
R:4A5:bossHealth:ENEMY bar, $30 at the start of a floor
R:4A6:playerHealth:PLAYER bar, $30 full; $FF = dead (also GameHacking.org)
R:4A8:objHitFacing:per slot: objFacing for the knocked-out fall: 1 when the object is left of the player (set in CheckPlayerHits, ShakeOffGrabbers, SmallEnemyContact)
R:4B0:objHitPlayer:per slot 0-3: this enemy already hit the player (no repeat until it backs off)
R:4B5:hitThisFrame:1 once an attack connected this frame (no second hit, boss DMC instead of the defeat sound)
R:4B6:attackLanded:CheckPlayerHits: the current attack hit something (cleared when no attack runs)
R:4B8:objMode:per slot: 1 broken pot, 2 ObjAppear/ObjVanish smoke (floor 4 boss), dragon: 5 rises from its ball, 3 breathes fire (EnemyAttackBox), 6 vanishes (DrawObjectState, Mesen)
R:4C0:popupPoints:per slot: score popup, offset into ScoreEntries; $FF = none
R:4C7:popupX:per slot: score popup screen X
R:4CE:popupY:per slot: score popup Y
R:4D5:objPointsStep:per slot: multiHitCount when hit, added to the points table index (AwardPoints)
R:4DC:objDistance:|objWorldX - player world X|, low byte (CalcPlayerDistances)
R:4E3:objDistanceHi
R:4EA:objLeftOfPlayer:1 = the object is left of the player (or at the same X)
R:4F6:missileTargetX:boss 4 missile: objWorldX of the boss +- $80 by facing (SetMissileTarget)
R:4FB:missileTargetXHi
R:500:scoreP1:score digits of player 1, copied to/from score
R:507:scoreP2:score digits of player 2
R:510:topScores:top score digits: game A at +0, game B at +7
R:51E:warmBootSig:$A5,$5A after the first power-on: RESET then keeps $0501-$050F
R:520:scoreAdd:points to add, one decimal digit per byte (AddScore)
R:527:scoreCarryDummy:AddScore stores a digit here that is never read
R:528:scorePpuHi:PutScore: PPU address of the score, high byte
R:529:scorePpuLo
R:52A:topScorePpuHi:PutTopScore: PPU address of the top score
R:52B:topScorePpuLo
R:52D:extraLifeGiven:per player: the 50000-point extra life was given
R:52F:oamFillByte:$F8: BuildOam fills the rest of oamBuffer with it
R:530:score:score digits of the current player, one decimal digit per byte (Data Crystal: $0531-$0535)
R:537:demoMode:DEMO_ON during the attract-mode demo, else 0
R:538:gameStartedUnused:set to 1 when a game starts, never read
R:539:demoInputTime
R:53B:modeFlag:per-mode toggle: title, floor start, floor clear tally/climb, Sylvia scene blink
R:53C:startMusicPlayed:MUSIC_GAME_START was played (only before the first floor of a game)
R:600:sprListA:OAM records built by DrawObjects
R:6D0:sprListB:OAM records of the small sprites: shots, effects (tiles $DB/$DC/$F0), sparks (DrawHitSparks, DrawEffects)
R:730:sprListC:OAM records built by DrawFloor4Sprites (floor 4 only)
R:7C0:sq2NoteLen
R:7C2:sq2NoteTimer
R:7C3:sq1EnvStep
R:7C6:sq1NoteTimer
R:7C8:triNoteLen
R:7CA:triNoteTimer
R:7D8:noiseSfxPlaying
R:7D9:dmcSfxPlaying:DMC request being repeated ($08 and up)
R:7DA:dmcSfxTimer
R:7DC:musicNoisePos:NOISE read offset in musicData
R:7DD:noiseNoteTimer
R:7DF:sq2EnvStep
R:7E3:sq2SfxTimer
R:7E8:bgmPart:song number 9-18 while the floor music ($01) plays
R:7E9:noiseSfxTimer
R:7EB:dmcSfxStep
